Package: laprdus
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, speech-dispatcher
Description: Croatian/Serbian/Bosnian Text-to-Speech Engine
 LaprdusTTS is a text-to-speech engine for Croatian, Serbian and Bosnian,
 with voices synthesized by rule (formant synthesis) and voices rendered
 from pre-recorded phoneme samples.
 .
 Features:
  * Voices: Josip, Vlado, Detence, Baba, Đedo, Zvonko (default), Stojan,
    Mirsad and ten singing voices; every voice speaks Croatian, Serbian
    and Bosnian
  * Speech Dispatcher integration for use with Orca screen reader
  * Command-line utility for terminal-based speech synthesis
  * Adjustable speech rate, pitch, and volume
  * Punctuation-based voice inflection
  * Number-to-words conversion

Package: laprdus-dev
Architecture: any
Depends: laprdus (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: LaprdusTTS development files
 This package provides the development headers and static libraries
 for LaprdusTTS, allowing developers to integrate Croatian, Serbian and
 Bosnian text-to-speech into their applications.
